    {
      "id": "claim_957b63bf467a4d1aa5f88f73586b8fad",
      "statement": "For employer securities, the file must record applicable trading windows, blackout periods, pre-clearance requirements, and any Rule 10b5-1 plan; discretionary trading during a blackout is prohibited and cannot be cleared by approval.",
