    {
      "id": "claim_20d85e087a9744e8a0feda9eee243cb2",
      "statement": "Every concentrated position requires a written unwind plan reviewed annually; a plan unchanged in three consecutive reviews is evidence it is not being applied and must be escalated under D.4.",
